  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo a la Modernizacin del Ministerio de Finanzas Pblicas</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Modernization of the Ministry of Public Finance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El programa estar orientado a apoyar y complementar los esfuerzos demodernizacin institucional del Ministerio de Finanzas Pblicas, con el propsito de (i) mejorar la eficiencia de sus operaciones internas, y (ii) fortalecer su capacidad rectora de los sistemas de administracin del estado y promover la transparencia en la ejecucin del gasto pblico.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program will support and complement the efforts toward institutional modernization of the Ministry of Public Finance, in order to: (i) make its internal operations more efficient; and (ii) strengthen its leadership of public administration systems and promote transparency in public expenditure.</narrative>
  </description>
